    {"probe_sha256":"3af8b30f6a7ce92e99677a492bbd4653b729571d0485a3c81dd19cb751041d0b","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 9.json","source_index":1987,"source_sha256":"2c85dd8afc2db09a39162e57d3d0a3dfe23d10aa9b549d9e9528cc093de406ca","text":"However, putting that goodwill aside, the makeshift partnership was extremely precarious."},
    {"probe_sha256":"3d96f24ff64185b47a6af29e418d236d7a5f8e40deab1df21a6493378025d287","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 8.json","source_index":2958,"source_sha256":"5e4fd0f258442e0064f90adff18bcac3b06ba5c6f5b8d45d2053fc6d07c62032","text":"…Yes, if it was you, then…"},
    {"probe_sha256":"4e50ce51333b5e3c16a28d3e5dc0eb03ab17d3e3f47ce9e1f7f7553033aa7038","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 5.json","source_index":1598,"source_sha256":"3c01319a8f06123e24f85dbf9a4771b0581315bd4a58a614fe19f6d40e33c217","text":"It had to be, and yet…"},
    {"probe_sha256":"cc3c9f08dbb751d76211bfe3aa2650fb60ecc8693556557fb8971c0ac114bb29","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 4.json","source_index":1244,"source_sha256":"6890de89e583beb13183fcdd0a1e2f264ac4246231294142454b1dd8cdb0b5a7","text":"…Incidentally, why did you get involved with them?"},
    {"probe_sha256":"4c77325f9bed2ebab745d43ce9ca5d4f3aab8ff2b22960747b23caaeca819482","source_path":"scripts/Arc 1 - Volume 1_4.json","source_index":446,"source_sha256":"5cdd325fc4f42ad4a130ca18a99364bb9dae135e798af51dbba5531a308377db","text":"But…really, this isn’t looking very good."},
    {"probe_sha256":"98a6e3a9dd95c9c6dddc4469c128e0c50b84e0f0c39df1189932b0b073c9cba4","source_path":"scripts/Arc 2 - Volume 2.json","source_index":3362,"source_sha256":"de264802173628bb4a958e00855409504fc4f36d23f7dd2c09cb6bdc8933fea8","text":"A call for me, I suppose?"},
    {"probe_sha256":"b4d76a9c8e11246518bf361c0e0aed927a862b812e334ff6c2a249aa31f8be27","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 4.json","source_index":1936,"source_sha256":"60b21a20868768383512cd7285d6bfbc866c5b724116317b366427bcc215446a","text":"Mind if I ask why not?"},
    {"probe_sha256":"dc7fdacc8a28020bdba1331a752c2ba2252a70db2961b72bd133b1259c32022e","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 6.json","source_index":364,"source_sha256":"07e232a9d1163894fedc337d734684e6f96291082dd7a1b64646826af0e066b6","text":"Abruptly, a voice struck Subaru, breaking the silence."},
    {"probe_sha256":"c59b56725d62dcf4b6852d89b565c89ace846b9525cdaec2594a91013a22f72f","source_path":"scripts/Arc 4 - Volume 10.json","source_index":669,"source_sha256":"e57df90e1aa6358b47d8eb93939a24b7dd18ef50ee0b5bc23372fabe6a4fa002","text":"The unexpected counterattack made Subaru unintentionally coarsen his voice."},
    {"probe_sha256":"5f8ff319d7991f500788f34da26d5e862123bb97d1c09193279ec6d63a743db4","source_path":"scripts/Arc 2 - Volume 2_3.json","source_index":1552,"source_sha256":"512d926604c91dd37c216f03656ff332cb2caf602788924f8c05d843ff01d46d","text":"Spontaneously shifted his feet toward the fast-approaching girl."},
    {"probe_sha256":"a6c707203fb0f19d47c0bba064c579f81795bd406c74c5127dff29fa58c63ab1","source_path":"scripts/Arc 2 - Volume 3_4.json","source_index":3756,"source_sha256":"a5ba08df661a5861fe030509171d4e2b86c40fb6b4e6031d315edb217b3d6a38","text":"Certainly the visible wounds have been healed, and fortunately, you need not be concerned about aftereffects hindering normal, everyday life. But…"},
    {"probe_sha256":"522cdf08fbbb4777767eea5aaf78d30f6e9446228f0ce8f824e4dc33c4a5980a","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 5.json","source_index":262,"source_sha256":"a2f236acdfa140676adff5560e6c5760ca135c69a810c25d92eae1f669047b08","text":"While Subaru distanced himself, Reinhard attempted to bridge the gap."},
    {"probe_sha256":"768bf54bc29a5d62f2efa4f79ae85e1d99b9c301b4352e980930516b896b2117","source_path":"scripts/Arc 4 - Volume 10.json","source_index":1125,"source_sha256":"53add16c56897ac8ba0a5ed7bd970b98f60185d2b457b6998fd66f79dc4fbcd3","text":"Thanks to the intervention of the wind repel blessing, neither loud sounds nor shaking were conveyed to the carriage interior. In that quiet atmosphere, they were not trading words about their enthusiasm at approaching the Sanctuary—rather, they were discussing an anomaly that had occurred during the last several days Puck’s absence."},
    {"probe_sha256":"458b5d91fbeabc1c245866cadef79f45e88c4e185f4db8721b72a71dd8777f69","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 7_2.json","source_index":1300,"source_sha256":"0c5c7c3ce79e44443e9e5b0357ea1a322e5d947ffae658918990c551136ffcce","text":"The twin cat people opened their mouths, unleashing overlapping roars of “Wa!” and “Ha!” The sound waves intermingled to combine into one, entwining as they transformed into destructive power. Then, the vast oscillation wave rippled across the plain, striking the onrushing mist head-on and blowing it apart."},
    {"probe_sha256":"98441f17066602de448d3560dbac502d85bb9ef14d34256ac54dfc6d5f7d87f5","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 8.json","source_index":2824,"source_sha256":"7dc6b24927054e8d56640389276b19ea97f2d0b44502a10eaa3cb6bc076489d0","text":"The blackened, charred objects scattered around the area were partly the dragon carriages and the corpses of their land dragons, but that none were intact made him unable to differentiate between organic and inorganic matter. It was surely a foregone conclusion that the dense scent of burning flesh invading his nostrils was from the land dragons that had perished in the blast."},
    {"probe_sha256":"d8911c8164e2b462711db417178c1ba6e94f5acf141e415b6dae7b1e6b7b10b5","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 5.json","source_index":1820,"source_sha256":"35aeb306dcff8c58d8a9c28a36175e48916612a72cc2f76b4bcd6c80a0ee3794","text":"The smoldering remnants were nearly extinguished."},
    {"probe_sha256":"6f909193f49638f09ca1f9ec0273ba4cdf97bd26aeeb1ae2ac1e954153159519","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 6.json","source_index":3215,"source_sha256":"e4870202f70ed1814c2b82b45aff13e58e66909b7c93456236897486c273b3f1","text":"It is easy to give up."},
    {"probe_sha256":"46ed65beb585798c0f81e390efd0fde89c2bfef696191e647960ec2f3444c420","source_path":"scripts/Arc 2 - Volume 3.json","source_index":403,"source_sha256":"35baa62ab5ae61e425510654c6f9af344d4237397073ce9880dbaabaad23a026","text":"Seeing words fail Subaru, Emilia abruptly murmured “all right” to herself quietly before continuing."},
    {"probe_sha256":"62c5f5c0897e2124abee53c76d8794698591170baaafcaf4212699dc0f08962a","source_path":"scripts/Arc 3 - Volume 5.json","source_index":1706,"source_sha256":"64217fd04ccc6be252be503d6af96292b4fae04bd308062e4d6bf90d4604de8d","text":"That said, they hadn’t shown any hostility, either."},
    {"probe_sha256":"ce13835fa4b9c8f72754ca4acac14d385313ed443d3b9b936285606cbcd837b8","source_path":"scripts/Arc 1 - Volume 1.json","source_index":1644,"source_sha256":"b1f0e3216f7ffd21a06eb350edf63bfa1b816f889da2123ebab1f7049d2c3c02","text":"Elsa said as, with a second kukri she had drawn from her waist, she sliced about 70 percent of the way through Subaru’s abdomen with her other hand, spilling out his blood and guts."},
    {"probe_sha256":"b270499fef2933c2577b496c2343997433fb2278c05a27097e8d792ee59909a4","source_path":"scripts/Arc 1 - Volume 1.json","source_index":1549,"source_sha256":"40237e4844b5f4d90bae025d656ad54a4c378f2cff77b47b130625821ce10a19","text":"Something was flying, spinning in the air."},
    {"probe_sha256":"13f8bbe12f82c92a08c5898d9bb0cd0479dfbdb75c9f8e9d375db1aa546bf4dd","source_path":"scripts/Arc 1 - Volume 1.json","source_index":906,"source_sha256":"5021051b0b723f8a018ac8bb31f973bb684239a0877822d55218d1fc2fc14fa1","text":"But Subaru wasn’t thinking about that."},
    {"probe_sha256":"cb126e8d5cc0493751bf098d97f1aa8baa063dce2ec87c4f29a8472ef62e0895","source_path":"scripts/Arc 2 - Volume 2.json","source_index":1966,"source_sha256":"b0126d9430c4ea0168395886e7f11e65c36d0c8bc44e18c8dbaf000b54c36211","text":"I do that a lot lately!"},
    {"probe_sha256":"9ffef60930acaeae18143aacc0d091aa73107e101907cd49bdb137cf740ba8ac","source_path":"scripts/Arc 4 - Volume 10.json","source_index":2797,"source_sha256":"08e6017386458e35488139cf27280dd42a0fe597d1914c82f15b5e28309dff85","text":"I found a girl I like."}
